# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not for publication.
#
# This repository is intended to become public. The files below are working
# material for the author and are deliberately untracked. They exist on disk;
# they are not part of the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Adversarial design review: reviewer verdicts, kill criteria, and candid
# commentary about how Mathlib maintainers triage contributions. Useful
# internally, actively harmful as the first thing a maintainer reads.
/REVIEW.md

# Working notes toward a Zulip post, LLM-drafted. Mathlib policy forbids posting
# LLM-written messages, so shipping the draft in a public repo would read as
# routing around that policy. Also carries private-project references.
/ZULIP-DRAFT.md

# Line-by-line didactic commentary on every file. Written for the author's own
# understanding; not a contribution, and it would double the apparent size of a
# repository whose actual content is one small Lean file.
/didactic/

# The pre-publication git history, archived before it was discarded. It contains
# the same private material as the files above, in both the file contents and
# the commit messages. Restore with `git clone history-archive.bundle`.
/history-archive.bundle
